\title{Softcapping}
\taxon{Definition}
\p{\em{Softcapping} is a [stability trick](7TMH) in the [attention](004G) mechanism. It is a way to ensure that the softmax does not explode.
   ##{\mathrm{logits} = \mathrm{softcap} \cdot \tanh \left( \frac{\mathrm{logits}}{\mathrm{softcap}} \right) }
}

